  "Scenes.Izma.IzmaSpecials1.JointStrikeRush": "Izma rushes you with impressive speed, striking a few precise locations on your joints with her fingertips before leaping back. It doesn't hurt, but you feel tired and sore. [say: Pressure points...] she laughs, seeing your confused expression."
